        "tab": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's Included",
            "content": "<ul><li>MyoLift™ Triwave Device <\/li><li>Forehead Mask<\/li><li>Lip Mask<\/li><li>Eye Mask<\/li><li>2oz Replenish Spritzer<\/li><li>4oz Renu Conductive Gel<\/li><li>Lead Wire<\/li><li>Charger<\/li><li>Applicator Probes<\/li><li>Mangosteen Cleanser<\/li><li>Revital C Serum<\/li><li>Eye Lift Serum <\/li><li>Anti-Aging Serum<\/li><li>MyoLift™ Bag <\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "cfc81da9-3fa6-4351-99ab-185a73614e19": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is this for?",
            "content": "<p>Anyone looking to<\/p><p>• Maintain a youthful appearance<\/p><p>• Minimize breakouts<\/p><p>• Reduce fine lines and wrinkles<\/p><p>• Detoxify their skin <\/p><p>• Build healthy skin cells<\/p><p>• Increase production of collagen and elastin<\/p><p>• Increase skin elasticity, fullness and bounciness<\/p><p><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "c470f05f-1b5f-4fc2-8e60-fc45d6f483ed": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does it compare to other devices?",
            "content": "<p>The Triwave goes up to 400 microamps and has 3 modalities including Educate, Erase and Rejuv. Rejuv stimulates the movement of lymph to cleanse and nourish skin health, supporting calm, clear skin. The Triwave is the only at home device to offer Rejuv!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "951d62a3-d4c7-4864-9c84-04d5894a1fc3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping & Handling",
            "content": "<p>Free USA Ground shipment, Orders are processed within 2 business day.<\/p><p>International Orders Ships within 3 business day. <\/p><p>International customers are required to pay Duty with their local custom agency. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
