        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "How does it work?",
        "text": "<p>1. Using our pinch and hold technique, you apply gentle current to targeted areas of the face using the probes attached to the Mini device (The area depends on where you’d like to see results)<\/p><p>2. This gentle current mimics the body’s natural current and stimulates the facial muscles, cell growth and collagen production in the Dermal layer of your skin.<\/p><p>3. Regular stimulation, improved cell growth and higher collagen production leads to evened out facial muscles and connective tissue, ultimately minimizing fine lines and wrinkles, lifting sagging areas and giving you a more youthful appearance. <\/p>",
